    narr:narration """The architecture stratum is currently defined by a singular, ratified commitment to [Zypherion for the analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1). This decision, voiced by Quinton Fairweather on August 17, 2026, is presented not as a proposal, but as a [fixed operational commitment](narr:Narrative_MigrationTimelineCommitment) that has already transitioned from deliberation to [ratified status](narr:Narrative_TechnologyAdoptionRatification). The framing of this choice is anchored in [matter-of-fact, list-based documentation](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), prioritizing clear, authoritative alignment over exploratory discourse. While the current record focuses on the adoption itself, the architectural framework remains open to [quantified performance justifications](narr:Narrative_PerformanceJustifiedInfrastructureChoice) as a mechanism for validating such infrastructure shifts, though no competing architectures or dissenting technical evaluations are currently surfaced within this hub.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4> ;
